# .NET Aspire Patterns

## Service Discovery
- Use `https+http://` URLs for service discovery
- Configure services in [AppHost/Program.cs](mdc:PetHoroscopeGenerator.AppHost/Program.cs)
- Reference services with `WithReference()`

## Service Configuration
- Add common services in [ServiceDefaults/Extensions.cs](mdc:PetHoroscopeGenerator.ServiceDefaults/Extensions.cs)
- Include health checks, resilience, and OpenTelemetry
- Use `AddServiceDefaults()` for consistent configuration

## HTTP Client Configuration
- Configure resilience with `AddStandardResilienceHandler()`
- Enable service discovery by default
- Use proper timeout and retry policies

## Health Checks
- Implement health checks for all services
- Use `AddDefaultHealthChecks()` for common checks
- Monitor service availability and dependencies

## OpenTelemetry
- Configure logging with `AddOpenTelemetry()`
- Include formatted messages and scopes
- Set up metrics and tracing

## Example Configuration:
```csharp
builder.Services.ConfigureHttpClientDefaults(http =>
{
    http.AddStandardResilienceHandler();
    http.AddServiceDiscovery();
});
```

## Service Registration
- Register services in the appropriate project
- Use dependency injection consistently
- Configure external endpoints with `WithExternalHttpEndpoints()`